sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Workflow
  participant Validator
  participant Source
  participant Target
  participant Accountant
  Workflow->>Validator: Request post-migration verification
  Validator->>Source: Read expected canonical controls
  Validator->>Target: Read actual synthetic records
  Validator->>Validator: Exact counts, relationships, balances and checksums
  Validator->>Workflow: Pass with evidence or mismatch blocker
  Workflow->>Accountant: Mismatch: inspect permitted remediation
  Accountant->>Workflow: Approve repair where required
  Workflow->>Validator: Revalidate after repair
